+
+#### [OLDP: Open Legal Data Platform](https://github.com/openlegaldata/oldp)
+> **Description:** OLDP is a Django-based web application for processing legal text and exposing legal documents through a REST API plus Elasticsearch-backed search. The README calls out support for court decisions, laws, courts, API access, and theme customization for country-specific deployments. That combination makes it unusually useful for public-interest legal information systems, law libraries, and regional legal publishers that want an open starting point. **GitHub metadata:** last commit/activity date `2026-03-15`, `133` stars, primary language `Python`, license `MIT`.
+
