+#### [Korean Law MCP](https://github.com/chrisryugj/korean-law-mcp)
+> **Description:** Korean Law MCP packages Korean statutes, precedents, ordinances, interpretations, and related legal materials into a large toolset that can be called from AI assistants or the terminal. The README positions it as an MCP server plus CLI for direct legal search and analysis, with chain tools for more complex research tasks. For lawyers or developers working with Korean law, it is one of the clearest examples of jurisdiction-specific legal AI infrastructure on GitHub. **GitHub metadata:** last commit/activity date `2026-04-06`, `1.2k` stars, primary language `TypeScript`, license `MIT`.
