+> **Description:** Pasal is an AI-native Indonesian legal platform that combines an MCP server, REST API, and web app to expose grounded access to Indonesian laws. Its README emphasizes structured article retrieval, amendment tracking, legal search across a large corpus, and verification against source PDFs to reduce hallucinations. That makes it much more than a chatbot wrapper; it is a serious jurisdictional legal data layer. **GitHub metadata:** last commit/activity date `2026-03-01`, `200` stars, primary language `TypeScript`, license `AGPL-3.0`.
