+### Contract Review & Document Intelligence
+
+#### [OpenContracts](https://github.com/Open-Source-Legal/OpenContracts)
+> **Description:** OpenContracts is one of the most capable open legal AI workspaces on GitHub. The README frames it as a free and open source document analytics platform with document ingestion, annotation, extraction, redaction, prompt-based analytics, and agent-ready knowledge workflows. For lawyers dealing with contracts, diligence, and large unstructured corpora, it stands out because it is not just a model demo; it is a full self-hosted platform for human and AI collaboration over documents. **GitHub metadata:** last commit/activity date `2025-10-26`, `1.3k` stars, primary language `TypeScript`, license `GPL-3.0`.
