+### Legal Research & Case Law
+
+#### [CourtListener](https://github.com/freelawproject/courtlistener)
+> **Description:** CourtListener is Free Law Project’s flagship legal research codebase and one of the strongest open repositories for case law access. The GitHub README describes it as a high-quality legal data and services platform, while the topic page highlights opinions, oral arguments, judges, financial records, and federal filings. For lawyers and legal researchers, it is best understood as an open legal research backbone rather than a simple demo app. **GitHub metadata:** last commit/activity date `2026-02-27`, `889` stars, primary language `Python`, license `AGPL-3.0`.
